blurb = "The text describes the habitat of the bears in the deep, snowy mountains of Kashū (modern-day Ishikawa prefecture). It details how hunters track the bears to their winter dens and explains that while the meat and fur are valuable, the gallbladder (used for medicine) is the most prized product."
